{
  "title": "Tenebrae",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "A dark, retro synth",
        "with an edge: basses",
        "that snarl, pads",
        "that drift, leads",
        "that scream, echoes",
        "that won't stop.",
        "",
        "Three pages make the",
        "sound: Osc, Filter,",
        "Amp + LFO. Two more",
        "polish it: FX Motion",
        "and FX Space.",
        "",
        "Every knob is a",
        "macro. Turn one",
        "thing, hear a lot."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Osc",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Model + Shape",
          "lines": [
            "MODEL picks the",
            "oscillator. SHAPE",
            "is its main tone.",
            "",
            "Saw: triangle, saw,",
            " then saw + square",
            "Pulse: width",
            "Sync: sync sweep",
            "FM: bite (1:1)",
            "Bell: metal, clang",
            "Wave: digital table",
            "Vox: oo-oh-ah-eh-ee",
            "Zap: pitch drop for",
            " toms and lasers"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "S.Env, Stack",
          "lines": [
            "S.ENV lets the",
            "filter envelope",
            "move SHAPE, up or",
            "down. FM plucks,",
            "sync sweeps, PWM.",
            "",
            "STACK:",
            " to 10: analog",
            "  beating, 3 oscs",
            " 10-30: the 3 pulled",
            "  wide, a reese",
            " 30-55: 5 oscs",
            " 55 up: 7, supersaw",
            "Low notes stay in",
            "the middle, high",
            "notes spread wide."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Layer, Blend",
          "lines": [
            "LAYER is a second",
            "source: a sub, a",
            "copy at an interval",
            "or noise.",
            "",
            "SIN is the clean sub.",
            "It skips the drive,",
            "the filter and the",
            "chorus, delay and",
            "reverb, so the",
            "bottom stays solid.",
            "SQR and -2 are",
            "vintage subs: they",
            "go through it all.",
            "",
            "BLEND: 0 is off,",
            "50 is both at full,",
            "100 is the layer",
            "alone."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Age, Glide",
          "lines": [
            "AGE: 0 is exact and",
            "tight. Up: each",
            "voice drifts and",
            "wobbles on its own,",
            "and every note lands",
            "a little different.",
            "Chords beat slowly.",
            "High is a tired old",
            "machine. Age adds",
            "no noise.",
            "",
            "GLIDE: Poly, Mono,",
            "or a glide time.",
            "Glide is mono and",
            "slides only when",
            "notes overlap."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Filter",
      "lines": [
        "TYPE: LP24, LP12,",
        "band-pass, high-pass",
        "CUT, RES: as usual.",
        "",
        "DRIVE has 3 zones.",
        "To 50: the mixer",
        "overdrives into the",
        "filter. Warm, thick.",
        "50-75: a hard clip",
        "after the amp, per",
        "note. Bite; chords",
        "stay clean, tails",
        "clean up.",
        "75 up: the whole",
        "voice mix is",
        "clipped together.",
        "Chords snarl.",
        "",
        "ENV is how far the",
        "envelope moves the",
        "cutoff, up or down.",
        "ATK DCY SUS shape",
        "it. It releases",
        "with the amp."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Amp + LFO",
      "lines": [
        "LFO picks what the",
        "LFO moves:",
        " PIT pitch (vibrato,",
        "  comes in late)",
        " SHP shape (PWM)",
        " FLT filter",
        " AMP tremolo",
        " PAN auto-pan",
        " S&H random filter",
        " RMP filter ramp in",
        "  time with tempo",
        "DEPTH 0 is off.",
        "",
        "With RMP, RATE picks",
        "1/4, 1/8, 1/8T, 1/16",
        "or 1/32.",
        "",
        "VEL: how much",
        "velocity changes",
        "level and tone.",
        "",
        "Row two is the amp",
        "envelope.",
        "",
        "Pad pressure and the",
        "mod wheel add",
        "vibrato. Pressure",
        "also opens the",
        "filter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FX Motion",
      "lines": [
        "CHORUS: I, II, I+II",
        "are the classic",
        "stereo chorus. ENS",
        "is a string machine",
        "ensemble. DIM is a",
        "subtle widener.",
        "MIX sets how much.",
        "",
        "PHASER + RATE.",
        "",
        "PUMP ducks the whole",
        "sound in time with",
        "the tempo, like a",
        "sidechain. DIV is",
        "how often.",
        "",
        "VHS: wow, flutter,",
        "lost top, some dirt.",
        "",
        "TONE down is dark",
        "and heavy. Up is",
        "airy, and cuts the",
        "lows so pads and",
        "plucks stay out of",
        "the bass."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FX Space",
      "lines": [
        "DELAY is ping-pong",
        "and tape-like: the",
        "repeats darken.",
        "TIME follows the",
        "tempo. FDBK sets",
        "the repeats.",
        "",
        "REVERB + SIZE.",
        "COLOR: dark to",
        "bright tail.",
        "SHIM adds an octave",
        "up into the tail.",
        "",
        "LEVEL: output."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tips",
      "lines": [
        "Bass: Glide = Mono,",
        "Layer = Sub, Drive",
        "to taste.",
        "",
        "Pad: Stack 40-70,",
        "slow attack, Chorus",
        "I, Reverb up.",
        "",
        "Pluck: Amp sustain",
        "0, Env up, short",
        "DCY, Delay 1/8 dot.",
        "",
        "Lead: Glide 60-150,",
        "LFO to Pitch, a",
        "little depth.",
        "",
        "Dark: Age up, VHS",
        "up, Tone down."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
